message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Reproduction package: testing critical slowing down in Mount Wilson S-index of Sun-like stars"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-25
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Borin Junior"
    given-names: "Airton M. S."
    affiliation: "Instituto Federal do Triangulo Mineiro (IFTM), Uberaba, Brazil"
abstract: "Code, input data, reference outputs and manuscript sources that reproduce every number, table and figure of the article on rolling-window early-warning indicators of critical slowing down in annual Mount Wilson S-index series of Sun-like stars and the Sun. Run reproduce.sh (about 6 minutes). Third-party input data keep the terms of their original sources; code is MIT. Needs network access once, to download Table 4 of Egeland et al. (2017)."
keywords:
  - critical slowing down
  - early-warning signals
  - stellar activity cycles
  - chromospheric activity
  - S index
  - Maunder minimum
repository-code: "https://github.com/gpefitura-web/P4"
